#: source/installation/index.md:1
msgid "Installation"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:3
msgid ""
"This section describes how to install and configure Nix for first-time use."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:5
msgid ""
"The current recommended option on Linux and MacOS is [multi-user](#multi-"
"user)."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:7
msgid "Multi-user"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:9
msgid ""
"This installation offers better sharing, improved isolation, and more "
"security over a single user installation."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:12
msgid "This option requires either:"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:14
msgid "Linux running systemd, with SELinux disabled"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:15
msgid "MacOS"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:17
msgid "**Updating to macOS 15 Sequoia**"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:19
msgid "If you recently updated to macOS 15 Sequoia and are getting"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:23
msgid ""
"when running Nix commands, refer to GitHub issue [NixOS/nix#10892](https://"
"github.com/NixOS/nix/issues/10892) for instructions to fix your installation "
"without reinstalling."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:25
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh -s -- --daemon\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:29
msgid "Single-user"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:31
msgid "Single-user is not supported on Mac."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:33
msgid "`warning: installing Nix as root is not supported by this script!`"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:35
msgid ""
"This installation has less requirements than the multi-user install, however "
"it cannot offer equivalent sharing, isolation, or security."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:38
msgid "This option is suitable for systems without systemd."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:40
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh -s -- --no-daemon\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:44
msgid "Distributions"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:46
msgid "The Nix community maintains installers for several distributions."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/index.md:48
msgid ""
"They can be found in the [`nix-community/nix-installers`](https://github.com/"
"nix-community/nix-installers) repository."
msgstr ""
